/-!
# Odd-primary kernels over Held and Janko4

Every finite perfect central cover of either actual sporadic carrier has a
two-group kernel. The literal center-quotient corollaries supply the Held
and Janko4 model inputs for A.2.19 and A.3.6. All local subgroup, action and
Sylow premises are proved in the imported modules. The separate exact
trivial-multiplier theorem also requires the two-primary calculations.
Source: Aschbacher–Smith I.1.3, printed p.407; GLS III Table 5.3p.
-/
